---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const repo = "https://github.com/m4rocks/claudiu";
const latest = `${repo}/releases/latest`;

const parts = [
    [1, "Session list"],
    [2, "Claude Code"],
    [3, "Shell panel"],
    [4, "Status"],
    [5, "Visual panel"],
    [6, "GitHub panel"],
    [7, "Accounts"],
    [8, "Linked sessions"],
];

// where each part sits in the screenshot (2000 x 1250), and its disc outside the frame
const zones = [
    [1, 18, 280, 428, 380],
    [7, 18, 1090, 428, 150],
    [2, 466, 58, 1088, 760],
    [3, 466, 830, 1088, 410],
    [5, 1580, 395, 400, 45],
    [6, 1580, 485, 400, 85],
    [8, 1580, 615, 400, 45],
    [4, 1580, 700, 400, 270],
];

// disc position and the point on the part its leader line starts from
const calls = [
    [1, -50, 470, 30, 470],
    [7, -50, 1165, 30, 1165],
    [2, 1000, -50, 1000, 70],
    [3, 1000, 1300, 1000, 1225],
    [5, 2050, 417, 1965, 417],
    [6, 2050, 527, 1965, 527],
    [8, 2050, 637, 1965, 637],
    [4, 2050, 830, 1965, 830],
];
---

<Layout
    title="Claudiu — a desktop app for juggling Claude Code sessions"
    description="Claudiu runs your own Claude Code CLI in a real terminal and keeps your sessions, projects, GitHub issues, accounts and usage in one native window, on Windows and macOS."
>
    <header class="wrap head">
        <a href="#top" class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-[15px] font-bold text-ink no-underline">
            <img src="/claudiu.svg" alt="" width="22" height="22" />Claudiu
            <span class="font-normal text-dim max-sm:hidden">Owner's manual</span>
        </a>
        <nav aria-label="Manual">
            <a href="#parts" class="max-sm:hidden">Parts</a>
            <a href="#spec" class="max-sm:hidden">Specifications</a>
            <a href={repo}>Source</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <main id="top">
        <!-- cover: title, spec table, exploded drawing -->
        <section class="wrap grid items-start gap-x-16 gap-y-12 pt-14 pb-20 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,4fr)_minmax(0,8fr)] lg:pt-20">
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-7">
                <h1 class="text-[clamp(64px,8vw,96px)] leading-[0.92] font-extrabold tracking-[-0.04em]">Claudiu.</h1>
                <p class="lede">
                    A native window for every <b>Claude Code</b> session you run. Your own <code>claude</code>,
                    in a real terminal, with only the parts around it.
                </p>
                <div>
                    <table class="spec">
                        <tbody>
                            <tr><th scope="row">Runs</th><td>your own <code>claude</code> CLI</td></tr>
                            <tr><th scope="row">Platforms</th><td>Windows, macOS</td></tr>
                            <tr><th scope="row">Login</th><td>none, Claude Code's own</td></tr>
                            <tr><th scope="row">Your data</th><td>stays on your machine</td></tr>
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                    <a class="download" href={latest}>
                        <span>Download <small>latest release</small></span>
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 15V3"/><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><path d="m7 10 5 5 5-5"/></svg>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <figure class="fig" id="parts">
                <svg viewBox="-100 -100 2200 1450" role="img" aria-labelledby="fig1">
                    <title id="fig1">Claudiu on macOS with demo sessions, the numbered parts pointed out</title>
                    <image href="/claudiu-window.webp" x="0" y="0" width="2000" height="1250" />
                    {zones.map(([n, x, y, w, h]) => <rect class={`zone p${n}`} x={x} y={y} width={w} height={h} rx="14" />)}
                    {calls.map(([n, cx, cy, px, py]) => (
                        <g>
                            <line class="lead" x1={px} y1={py} x2={cx} y2={cy} />
                            <circle class="pin" cx={px} cy={py} r="7" />
                            <a class="call" href={`#p${n}`} data-k={n} aria-label={`Part ${n}: ${parts[n - 1][1]}`}>
                                <circle cx={cx} cy={cy} r="34" /><text x={cx} y={cy}>{n}</text>
                            </a>
                        </g>
                    ))}
                </svg>
                <figcaption>
                    <nav class="key" aria-label="Parts">
                        {parts.map(([n, t]) => (
                            <a href={`#p${n}`} data-k={n}><span class="disc">{n}</span>{t}</a>
                        ))}
                    </nav>
                    <p class="cap"><b>Fig. 1</b>Claudiu on macOS, with demo sessions. Point at a number to find the part.</p>
                </figcaption>
            </figure>
        </section>


        <div class="wrap"><div class="win"><div class="tb"><span>Claudiu</span><span>Fig. 2 · each part where it sits in the window</span></div><section class="cell p1" id="p1" aria-labelledby="t1"><h2 id="t1"><span class="disc">1</span> One list. Every session.</h2><p>Running first, in the order you drag them; recent below; older folded away. Projects are a filter, not a tree, and what was running comes back after a restart.</p><figure><div class="panel"><div class="lbl">Running</div><div class="rowline"><span class="dot"></span>Fix the flaky sync test<span class="chip">pilotist</span></div><div class="rowline"><span class="dot"></span>Review PR 62<span class="chip">giolt</span></div><div class="lbl mt-3">Recent</div><div class="rowline"><span class="dot off"></span>Redesign<span class="chip">website</span></div><div class="lbl mt-3">Older · 23</div></div></figure></section><section class="cell p7" id="p7" aria-labelledby="t7"><h2 id="t7"><span class="disc">7</span> Several accounts, each with its own limits.</h2><p>Each account's 5-hour and 7-day limits stay in view. Alt accounts keep their own login and share your settings; use only accounts you own. Claudiu never sees a password.</p><figure><div class="panel"><div class="flex justify-between"><span class="lbl">5 hour</span><span class="text-[14px]">67% · resets in 2h 14m</span></div><div class="meter" style="--v:67%"><i></i></div><div class="mt-4 flex justify-between"><span class="lbl">7 day</span><span class="text-[14px]">34% · resets in 4d 8h</span></div><div class="meter" style="--v:34%"><i></i></div></div><table class="spec wide"><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Main</th><td>your normal <code>~/.claude</code></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Alt</th><td>own login, shared settings and history</td></tr></tbody></table></figure></section><section class="cell p2" id="p2" aria-labelledby="t2"><h2 id="t2"><span class="disc">2</span> The real Claude Code.</h2><p>One real terminal per session, running your own <code>claude</code>. Alt+P, Shift+Tab, mouse and paste behave as in any terminal; Claudiu keeps only a few keys. On macOS, use Cmd.</p><figure><table class="spec wide keys"><tbody><tr><th scope="row"><kbd>Ctrl</kbd> <kbd>J</kbd></th><td>Shell under the session</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><kbd>Ctrl</kbd> <kbd>Shift</kbd> <kbd>]</kbd></th><td>Keyboard between Claude and shell</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><kbd>Ctrl</kbd> <kbd>Shift</kbd> <kbd>R</kbd></th><td>Right sidebar</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Everything else</th><td>Goes to Claude Code</td></tr></tbody></table></figure></section><section class="cell p3" id="p3" aria-labelledby="t3"><h2 id="t3"><span class="disc">3</span> A shell under each session.</h2><p>A plain shell in the session's folder. It keeps running while you look elsewhere and ends with its session.</p><figure><svg class="w-full" viewBox="0 0 460 200" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="1" y="1" width="458" height="118" rx="8" stroke="var(--color-ink)" stroke-width="1.5" /><rect x="1" y="131" width="458" height="68" rx="8" stroke="var(--color-ink)" stroke-width="1.5" /><g stroke="var(--color-faint)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="20" y1="28" x2="200" y2="28" /><line x1="20" y1="54" x2="320" y2="54" /><line x1="20" y1="158" x2="120" y2="158" /><line x1="20" y1="180" x2="240" y2="180" /></g><g stroke="var(--color-orange)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="200" y1="125" x2="260" y2="125" /><path d="m224 112 6-6 6 6" /><path d="m224 138 6 6 6-6" /></g></svg></figure></section><section class="cell p4" id="p4" aria-labelledby="t4"><h2 id="t4"><span class="disc">4</span> Status, without spending tokens.</h2><p>Context, prompt cache, auto-compact and advisor, reported by Claude Code itself.</p><figure><div class="panel"><div class="flex justify-between"><span class="lbl">Context</span><span class="text-[14px]">28k of 167k</span></div><div class="meter" style="--v:17%"><i></i></div><div class="scale" aria-hidden="true"><span>0</span><span>50</span><span>100</span></div><div class="rowline mt-2">Auto-compact<span class="chip">On</span></div><div class="rowline">Advisor<span class="chip">Opus</span></div></div></figure></section><section class="cell p5" id="p5" aria-labelledby="t5"><h2 id="t5"><span class="disc">5</span> Claude draws beside the terminal.</h2><p>Markdown and HTML with inline CSS, drawn natively as it streams. No scripts, no external images.</p><figure><div class="panel"><div class="flex justify-between"><span class="font-semibold">Roadmap</span><span class="note">drawing…</span></div>{[["Q1", "90%"], ["Q2", "55%"], ["Q3", "20%"]].map(([q, v]) => (<div class="mt-3 flex items-center gap-3 text-[14px]"><span class="w-6 text-dim">{q}</span><div class="meter mt-0 flex-1" style={`--v:${v}`}><i></i></div></div>))}</div></figure></section><section class="cell p6" id="p6" aria-labelledby="t6"><h2 id="t6"><span class="disc">6</span> Issues and PRs, beside the work.</h2><p>The project's issues and pull requests in a wide panel. Claude attaches the ones it works on.</p><figure><table class="spec wide"><tbody><tr><th scope="row">#59</th><td>Resizable sidebars</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">#61</th><td>Floating panels</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">PR 62</th><td>Fix session status settings</td></tr></tbody></table></figure></section><section class="cell p8" id="p8" aria-labelledby="t8"><h2 id="t8"><span class="disc">8</span> Sessions can reach each other.</h2><p>Read another session, search projects, start a session elsewhere. Only when you ask; all local.</p><figure><svg class="w-full" viewBox="0 0 460 120" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="1" y="15" width="170" height="90" rx="8" stroke="var(--color-ink)" stroke-width="1.5" /><rect x="289" y="15" width="170" height="90" rx="8" stroke="var(--color-ink)" stroke-width="1.5" /><line x1="171" y1="60" x2="289" y2="60" stroke="var(--color-orange)" stroke-width="1.5" /><circle cx="230" cy="60" r="5" fill="var(--color-orange)" /><text x="20" y="56" fill="var(--color-ink)" font-size="15" font-weight="600">pilotist</text><text x="20" y="80" fill="var(--color-dim)" font-size="13">sync fix</text><text x="308" y="56" fill="var(--color-ink)" font-size="15" font-weight="600">giolt</text><text x="308" y="80" fill="var(--color-dim)" font-size="13">started from pilotist</text></svg></figure></section><section class="cell sp" id="spec" aria-labelledby="tspec"><h2 id="tspec">Specifications.</h2><p>Claudiu owns the workspace. Claude Code owns the agent.</p><div class="mt-auto"><table class="spec wide"><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Built with</th><td>Rust and GPUI, a native app, not a web wrapper</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Terminal</th><td>one real PTY per session, ConPTY on Windows</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Anthropic API</th><td>never called by Claudiu</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Claude Code config</th><td>never edited by Claudiu</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Uploads</th><td>none: transcripts, code and keys stay local</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">After a restart</th><td>running sessions come back</td></tr></tbody></table><a class="download" href={latest}><span>Download <small>Windows and macOS</small></span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 15V3"/><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><path d="m7 10 5 5 5-5"/></svg></a><div class="mt-3 flex gap-6 text-[15px] text-dim"><a href={`${repo}/releases`}>All releases</a><a href={repo}>Source on GitHub</a></div></div></section></div></div>
    </main>

    <footer class="wrap head border-t border-b-0 text-[14px]">
        <a href="https://m4.rocks">Made with &hearts; by @m4rocks</a>
        <a href="#top">Back to Fig. 1</a>
    </footer>
    <p class="wrap text-[13px] text-dim pb-6">Claudiu is an independent project, not affiliated with, endorsed by or sponsored by Anthropic. Claude and Claude Code are trademarks of Anthropic.</p>
</Layout>
